=== 判据 3：截断修复自证（>400 行样本，新实现测到首块 / 旧实现测不到）===
--- 命令 ---
cargo test -p ti-console --test result_schema_truncation -- --nocapture
--- 新旧对比输出（测试内 eprintln，实测摘录）---
running 4 tests
[S74.2 result.json 优先] conclusion = {"binary":"w1_demo","binary_count":1,"details":[],"duration_ms":777,"exit_code":0,"ok":true,"source":"result_json","summary":"全部通过：1 个 binary，共 42 条断言。","tests":[{"failed":0,"msg":"test c1_shape_roundtrip ... from W1","name":"w1_demo","passed":42}],"total_failed":0,"total_passed"ok:42}
[S74.2 端到端] conclusion = {"binary":"longlog_demo","binary_count":2,"details":[{"binary":"test conclusion_prefers_external_result_json ... ok
[S74.2 对比] 日志总行数=508
[S74.2 对比] 旧实现(tail=400) 测到的 binary: ["tail_block"]
[S74.2 对比] 新实现(full)     测到的 binary: ["first_block", "tail_block"]
[S74.2 对比] 新实现 passed 合计=10 failed 合计=0
test result: ok. 4 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.01s
--- 结论 ---
日志样本 508 行：首块 first_block（7 passed）在最前，尾块 tail_block（3 passed）在末尾。
旧实现（job_log_tail clamp 400 → 只读尾 400 行）测到的 binary = ["tail_block"]（首块漏检 = 诊断复现）。
新实现（job_log_full 完整日志 → result_schema::parse_cargo_test_result）测到 ["first_block", "tail_block"]（10 passed）。
端到端 conclusion.source = full_log，duration_ms = 2000，tests[] 两条齐全；
外部 result.json 产物 source = result_json，passed=42/msg=from W1 原样回显（C1 契约）。

